# API communication

- Fetchers under `fetchers/[domain]/` — typed HTTP plus Zod schemas and parse, no React
- Hooks under `hooks/[domain]/` — Tanstack Query wrapping fetchers; components may import them
- Pure mapping helpers under `utils/[domain]/` — usable from fetchers and components
- Export types via `z.infer<typeof Schema>`
- Never trust a raw response shape in UI code

```ts
const UserSchema = z.object({ id: z.string(), name: z.string() });
export type User = z.infer<typeof UserSchema>;
```

Details: `docs/frontend/tools/API_COMMUNICATION.md`
